* Mon Oct 12 2026 Tobias Kaminski <instance_maintainer@protonmail.com> - 0.5.1-1
- About page with the version, the source code, the privacy policy,
  the security review and where to report a problem
- The settings show only the storage, the download queue and About;
  an album's download is removed on its page

* Mon Oct 12 2026 Tobias Kaminski <instance_maintainer@protonmail.com> - 0.5.0-1
- First release: the music on the phone and on your own Jellyfin
  server, streamed or downloaded to play without a network
- Log in with the password or Quick Connect; the password is never
  stored
- Albums, playlists and favorites download in their original quality,
  pause and resume, and stop before the free space runs low
- Without a network the library shows only downloaded music, with its
  covers
- Plays and favorites go to the server, made offline they follow later;
  add to a playlist or start a new one
- Lock screen, cover and Bluetooth controls; the track and position are
  kept when the app is closed

